{title: The Wonderful Cross}
{artist: Isaac Watts (verses), Chris Tomlin, J.D. Walt, Jesse Reeves (chorus)}
{group: Chris Tomlin}
{genre: Modern Worship}
{style: Contemporary}
{flow: Response}
